@startuml MRanked_Replication_Backup
title M-Ranked — replication, backup and restore (TO-BE)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

node "Primary server" as primary #E3F2FD {
  database "PostgreSQL primary" as pg
  folder "WAL spool\nbounded" as walspool
  component "Backup/retention agent" as agent
  folder "Cold export staging" as staging
}

node "Private encrypted channel\nWireGuard + TLS" as tunnel

node "Secondary DR server" as secondary #E8F5E9 {
  database "Hot standby" as standby
  folder "WAL archive" as wal
  folder "Base backups" as base
  folder "Cold Parquet archive" as cold
  component "Restore verifier" as verifier
  database "Ephemeral restore target" as restored
}

cloud "Optional immutable copy" as immutable #FFF8E1
actor "Operator" as operator

pg --> tunnel : async streaming WAL
tunnel --> standby : replay continuously
pg --> walspool : archive_command
walspool --> tunnel : encrypted WAL segments
tunnel --> wal : append + checksum
agent --> pg : pg_basebackup / backup tool
agent --> tunnel : encrypted base backup
tunnel --> base : store + retention
agent --> staging : verified partition export
staging --> tunnel : Parquet + manifest
tunnel --> cold : store + checksum
base --> immutable : scheduled encrypted copy
wal --> immutable : scheduled encrypted copy

base --> verifier : selected backup
wal --> verifier : WAL through target time
verifier --> restored : restore + PITR
verifier --> restored : schema/count/checksum queries
verifier --> operator : signed drill report
standby --> operator : lag and replay alerts
walspool --> operator : queue/disk alerts

note top of standby
  Цель: оперативное переключение чтения/восстановления.
  Реплика не является защитой от логической ошибки.
end note

note bottom of base
  Proposed SLO:
  RPO <= 15 min
  RTO <= 2 h
  daily automated verification
  quarterly full restore drill
end note

note bottom of cold
  Удаление hot partition разрешено только если:
  manifest создан, checksum совпал,
  row_count проверен и sample read успешен.
end note
@enduml
